<title>FRANCE: Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes optional durum - trade.</title>
<headline>Tunisia seeks 100,000 tonnes optional durum - trade.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia will tender on February 20 to import 100,000 tonnes of optional-origin durum wheat for</p>
<p>shipment in March, April and May, European grain traders said on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>Exporters said Algeria was seeking the wheat in four lots of</p>
<p>25,000 tonnes each.</p>
<p>Traders provided the following breakdown by shipment</p>
<p>periods.</p>
<p>    Tonnage	     Shipment date</p>
<p>    25,000 T	    March 20-31</p>
<p>    25,000 T	    April 10-20</p>
<p>    25,000 T	    May 1-10</p>
<p>    25,000 T	    May 20-31</p>
<p>-- Paris newsrom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
